{"data": [{"author_id": "1982071167390568448", "created_at": "2026-11-02T02:03:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117075003833454683"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 273, "start": 267, "tag": "China"}]}, "id": "2117075003833454683", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China's central bank switched its main policy rate. The PBoC anchor is now the overnight reverse repo at 1.25%, replacing the 7-day at 1.40%. First operation: CNY 541bn. Billed as technical, but analysts read it as an effective ~15bp cut in short-term funding costs. #China", "url": "https://x.com/FlagsAndFilings/status/2117075003833454683"}, {"author_id": "1551655474176704515", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:50:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117041719636033799"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 177, "start": 170, "tag": "TikTok"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "vm.tiktok.com/ZN8yN1sFu/", "end": 201, "expanded_url": "https://vm.tiktok.com/ZN8yN1sFu/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117041722081308672/CIqNx_WP?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117041722081308672/CIqNx_WP?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 178, "status": 200, "title": "TikTok · Joe Redden | Older Millennial", "unwound_url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@theoldermillennial/video/7702957446976802079?_r=1&_t=ZN-9B3RV2tcDuI", "url": "https://t.co/9SAVlP2Qit"}]}, "id": "2117041719636033799", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The EU is trying to steal &amp; control Polands gold Bank reserves &amp; control them by forcing them to use the euro! \n\nCheck out Joe Redden | Older Millennial's video! #TikTok https://t.co/9SAVlP2Qit", "url": "https://x.com/JackDougie2/status/2117041719636033799"}, {"author_id": "2022599713724276736", "created_at": "2026-11-02T01:59:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117074145124991166"], "id": "2117074145124991166", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Also on the tape, to 8:59 ET\n\nPeople's Bank of China conducts overnight reverse repo injecting CNY 541 billion at a 1.25% rate\n\nUS Central Command said the Iranian Foreign Minister's recent assertion that Iran has not attacked civilians in neighbouring countries is false, stating", "url": "https://x.com/movesurge/status/2117074145124991166"}, {"author_id": "66304778", "created_at": "2026-11-02T01:49:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117071604698018182"], "id": "2117071604698018182", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Bitcoin's back near $78.4K tonight, and I still can't tell you how much of last week was Binance and how much was tech. This week has a test for each.\n\n1) Mon Nov 2. Binance's new proof of reserves. The Oct 31 snapshot is taken and the zero-knowledge proof is due Monday, with Nov", "url": "https://x.com/TheDeFiGravity/status/2117071604698018182"}, {"author_id": "1958516116290248704", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036648651276546"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Vb976xffwM", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/HYPERBEASTAI/status/2117036648651276546/video/1", "media_key": "7_2117036477175488512", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/Vb976xffwM"}]}, "id": "2117036648651276546", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 137, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🇨🇳 China is calling in the rescue team. After AI and chip stocks crashed through October, the central bank and the securities regulator have set two meetings for Mo