Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117019245401792850"], "id": "2117019245401792850", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Guess I was right to assume we wouldn’t get any more news until at least TGA if not the anniversary in March", "url": "https://x.com/Rueniz/status/2117019245401792850"}, {"author_id": "1998622812739964928", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:28:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036009657655659"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "An independent four-year audit of whether Australia's Therapeutic Goods Administration complied with the enhanced COVID-19 vaccine safety monitoring it promised. 3 of 19 outputs documented.", "display_url": "paulrekaris.github.io/TGA-COVID19-Va…", "end": 250, "expanded_url": "https://paulrekaris.github.io/TGA-COVID19-Vaccine-Safety-Monitoring-Audit/", "start": 227, "status": 200, "title": "Did Australia's TGA monitor COVID vaccine safety as promised?", "unwound_url": "https://paulrekaris.github.io/TGA-COVID19-Vaccine-Safety-Monitoring-Audit/", "url": "https://t.co/cFteL3Up0s"}]}, "id": "2117036009657655659", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "If a government says it will \"actively and comprehensively monitor\" vaccine safety, how would you know it did?\n\nIn 2021, the TGA set out 19 outputs in its monitoring plan. The public record fully documents delivery of just 3.\n\nhttps://t.co/cFteL3Up0s", "url": "https://x.com/prekas23/status/2117036009657655659"}, {"author_id": "2998978524", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:10:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117016369086771651"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/xcNSrzGv9D", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/turbopisser/status/2117016369086771651/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117016324673003520", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co